/// `arch -x86_64 <cmd>` occurrences in a line of a step script. Unanchored:
/// compound-command forms (`cd x && arch -x86_64 bash ...`,
/// `out=$(arch -x86_64 bash ...)`, `sudo arch -x86_64 bash ...`)
